# Docker build context = repo root (uv workspace). Keep the context small and secret-free.
.git
.env*
!.env.example
node_modules
**/node_modules
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
apps
packages
platform
# docs/ is excluded EXCEPT the public copy the gateway reads at runtime: the help centre and
# the about page ground the public Ask Wobo (ask_public.py). Without them the index is empty
# and every question gets the honest line, so they ship in the image.
docs
!docs/copy
!docs/copy/**
infra
# content/catalogs and content/factbase STAY in the context: the Dockerfile COPYs
# concepts.json (plexus/store.py concept registry) and facts.v*.jsonl (the correctness
# fact-check gate) into the image. Only the runtime-written artifact cache is excluded.
content/cache
.playwright-mcp
*.png
*.jpeg
*.pdf
